    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/82e81f25b9a291b1d48854f7a8811254.poster.avif?t=1755572693\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/82e81f25b9a291b1d48854f7a8811254.webm?t=1755572693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/82e81f25b9a291b1d48854f7a8811254.mp4?t=1755572693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Fishing game with a Rhythm gimmick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/6916c0328d8785773dccaa39dd0fa4fc.avif?t=1755572693\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REEL TO THE BEAT!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reeling is essential! and you must reel to the beat of the song!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch several fishes each with their own original song!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Cute Retro 3D graphic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Visual inspired by Early 2000's aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange locations in the lake, how much deeper does this lake go?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a curious fisher who felt the calling to come to this mysterious lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are affected my the power of the mermaid. and you must learn to sync with their music in order to fish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eventually you will find out how much deeper this lake can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong><br>Unique Rhythm gameplay! - Fishing in this game will be to the beat of the song and you must maintain the line tension at all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make melodies along with the music! - Reeling in this game will also play melodies along with the music. Making music feels unique every time you fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many strange environment! - you may get to fish in a place that you never thought to fish before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Strange collection of fishes! - Many fishes are not anything you have seen before! They can be quite strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Planned features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom fish editor: create your own fish and song then release it in a community pond for other players to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More strange area, more fish gimmick,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics that you can obtain by exploring or perfecting a certain number of fishes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/82e81f25b9a291b1d48854f7a8811254.poster.avif?t=1755572693\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/82e81f25b9a291b1d48854f7a8811254.webm?t=1755572693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/82e81f25b9a291b1d48854f7a8811254.mp4?t=1755572693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Fishing game with a Rhythm gimmick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/6916c0328d8785773dccaa39dd0fa4fc.avif?t=1755572693\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REEL TO THE BEAT!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reeling is essential! and you must reel to the beat of the song!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch several fishes each with their own original song!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Cute Retro 3D graphic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Visual inspired by Early 2000's aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange locations in the lake, how much deeper does this lake go?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a curious fisher who felt the calling to come to this mysterious lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are affected my the power of the mermaid. and you must learn to sync with their music in order to fish them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eventually you will find out how much deeper this lake can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong><br>Unique Rhythm gameplay! - Fishing in this game will be to the beat of the song and you must maintain the line tension at all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make melodies along with the music! - Reeling in this game will also play melodies along with the music. Making music feels unique every time you fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many strange environment! - you may get to fish in a place that you never thought to fish before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Strange collection of fishes! - Many fishes are not anything you have seen before! They can be quite strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Planned features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom fish editor: create your own fish and song then release it in a community pond for other players to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More strange area, more fish gimmick,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics that you can obtain by exploring or perfecting a certain number of fishes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
